## 6. Restrictions — Applies to all licensees

Regardless of the license tier, the following are prohibited:

a) **Competing fork** — you may not fork this Software, rebrand it, and distribute
   it as a competing product or service that substitutes for Navyr commercially.

b) **License circumvention** — you may not remove, modify, or circumvent any license
   key enforcement, feature gating, or edition detection mechanisms in the Software.

c) **Attribution removal** — you may not remove or alter copyright notices, trademarks,
   or attribution references in the Software or its documentation.

d) **Sublicensing** — you may not sublicense the Software to third parties beyond
   what is explicitly permitted by your license tier.

